      "uid": "zhcn:66f7962da8db69cd3811c3bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高尚骏逸也一样抱着强烈的对抗意识。\n里见皇冠是本时代最为「伟大」的赛马娘……\n所以想要赢过她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0876f412dbf3fe52fa90f6ff0074401a654e3d8ad8a05614e702eec56249f070",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
