    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29408ed2c8b723de80962f1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "竞赛当天。北部玄驹与高尚骏逸\n对里见皇冠宣战。除了她们之外，\n还有很多对手都想着打倒里见皇冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "664312223f4df09b0e1e46d72651f5958e501b5c5022ac518a061dfa44edb26c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088418.json",
