    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3086d110a3040f3fc0052cd0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠跑出了一场令人印象深刻的出道战。\n训练员则决心相信自己的努力，向前迈进。\n看到这两人──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5bfd058fa94421aaa8b9a536141e40e89522d9b0dea83dee2f86f870ce2a303",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0985751dd340a7a01fc8ce06",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37c7fbb58728520e38f06414",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻自愿担任里见皇冠的\n附属训练员，想趁着进入巅峰期前\n学习训练相关知识。",
      "source_fingerprint": "573cf9354bb2d349320e16ecfeda1f99b4c186b5b8e8071f2775d464b7cb7aad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35b1db23340d92ef26e6a29c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ae63dbaebc9828351ff24da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人就这样迎接了新伙伴，\n并且展开日夜练习的时光。\n下个目标是「东京体育杯两岁锦标」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ec028f30114bc0f2bd845aff9c2cdc9454e264b8d48df2c53a0ff5befede374",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70c175f11597da8a2cab919",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后·Start！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bc38e369592e96ba0606fc2eb88ea15877d429a3f7e77e5084f048f5f508c36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c92c2fa24c2b4a18b09947",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠在比赛中耗尽所有体力。\n看来是因为她干劲十足地想赢得主要竞赛，\n这份紧张感导致她过度疲劳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ea9ae04864b85c3efb1aa8c651eebec7edf867abfef4401a18c797c2cb77bf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b5dc15ec4ac96a6d75cafb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了成为知名赛马娘，不会再重蹈覆辙。\n她如此承诺后选择走上的道路是经典三冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16835201dae40e2b7c662c51b853c7b0627483727d15ba28904f3d4fd428e51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:735e4ddc9c8bab0a76d6dce6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "「皋月赏」、「日本德比」、「菊花赏」，\n其中的「德比赛马娘」更是\n成为知名赛马娘格外想拿下的荣誉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c17a64372428853cf2eda1ada1e3c7c157d641a800fd59d09e3d9b1b08a71e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:938646de2c5ce334db844b18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一场比赛是「皋月赏」前哨战「弥生赏」。\n为了做好万全准备，她决定\n将新马级剩下的时间全都用来调整状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a32cc8b0904ca1598aea067847d35ef8b44b408323afda9aad2fca50f855c45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc72b07c8b910df6bfd580b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东京体育杯两岁锦标结束后·迈向顶尖",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d3ba0d005ccd984314dc1905c36ebcd0d9cdae8c42dc24b62997fff77b8cdd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
