    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c84524339fc663e9e921179",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠在「弥生赏」展现了自己的实力，\n并对记者们道出挑战经典三冠的自信。\n看到这样的她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7809e0c902f90304e9d1cab8c35619a53fba4fc90d5f015a16e7dcca0ed2a213",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088421.json",
      "json_path": [
