    {
      "uid": "zhcn:282b4dd19825e250c1c7b81c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同世代的赛马娘中……有人感到挫败。\n有人决心不放弃，全心投入训练。\n还有人──",
      "source_fingerprint": "856ef2dac2ba7d7f872e4ef26171935fabbbfb8ac586ebcf31b610bbe4bd036a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e7f02341d27ce94806c808a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec853f914893f791d60b752e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "静静地燃起斗志，\n决心一定要打倒她，迈向最强宝座。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ec28738c7e17753d8f4642f045e6f4d353f293062887b533bccdf9e5d9a5628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
