      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同世代选手们各自的思绪化成风暴，\n交织于经典三冠路线。\n而其中第一章「皋月赏」即将开幕──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a96d9d31e1bf5532563cc870d6c9e7fc7083a8273e7862468d4f12bf67e7031a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
